{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cc8851cbc0a01392ee50d0480749fa9d722100f756cc0bf702e269714b472927", "ja": "おーい、風花。今から時間いいか？\n次の公演の打ち合わせをしたいんだ。", "zh": "喂～风花，你现在方便吗？\n我想跟你开会商讨下次公演的事宜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4a513dad1e9290c584a483c7232216116ff56340f00f3b2a7c0a90a22ae151c3", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　はい、もちろん\n大丈夫です。レッスンも終わりましたし、何時間でも♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！是，当然没问题。\n练习也结束了，要讨论几个小时都可以♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1002_p", "source_sha256": "015211f17e339fabe815f99fd85b4b820e4ca2b763221ff5d7630bf07e1c7986", "ja": "はは、すごい気合いだな。\nよし、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "哈哈，你真有干劲呢。\n好，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "6227e89b75e01de963236ab78787f3e9313288420e1fad5999978b80f21a04ff", "ja": "お待ちくださいな。その打ち合わせ、\nわたくし達も参加させていただけませんこと？", "zh": "稍等一下。这场会议，\n本小姐我们也可以列席参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "a2f7b68646c911c77f161aaa7fb7d5a145086dd4afb17aad9b425b32703fac04", "ja": "わ、私たちも、風花さんの公演の……\nお、お手伝いをしたいんです。", "zh": "我、我们，也想要帮忙……\n风、风花姊筹备公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a183e6d8ebaed062fbec2845046889437dd85df65da078170a724fe5813a1f45", "ja": "千鶴さんと可憐が？　……なるほど、いいと思うな。\nふたりなら、風花をしっかり支えてくれそうだ。", "zh": "千鹤和可怜要帮忙？这样啊……我觉得也挺不错。\n我相信你们两个一定能好好协助风花的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5382b4cd3217ded592437c3af2573b00cf3edba99ff2712f99678dd46bde1a99", "ja": "そうですよねっ！　よかった～♪\nふたりとも改めて、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "你也这么认为吗！太好了～♪\n再次说声请你们多多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1e48bb55a50301426f3ea7335c08003cc7cd34d0e2411e4af6216a34702413cf", "ja": "それじゃ早速、打ち合わせを始めよう。まずは公演の\nテーマだけど……風花は、どんなのがいいと思う？", "zh": "那事不宜迟，开始讨论吧。\n首先是公演主题……风花，你觉得怎样好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dcc2b8170b2dcb79b78d20c08f4948e9c42e928f92b4464c96cc833c1f246530", "ja": "公演のテーマですか？　ええっと～♪\n……はっ。", "zh": "公演的主题吗？这个嘛～♪\n……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99426d386ea8a7cdb05e943bce33753a53d32ba72aec327d10b1525d44daaa6b", "ja": "あの～、私がやりたいことを、言って……\nいいんですよね？", "zh": "那个～我应该可以提出……\n自己想做的事对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6d6dcbaf44553598f97bf9039802b3937714ea66fc103d62f8c2e85190f0b80f", "ja": "ん？　もちろん。\n何かあるなら教えて欲しいな。", "zh": "嗯？当然可以。\n有想法的话希望你能直接说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bb0760a037aaf83c408c899edbced112f575bb7a42c7fd8515de5693e7010bde", "ja": "わ、わかりました。\nじゃあ……い、言いますね？", "zh": "我、我知道了。\n那……我、我要说啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9dc824c65f338b22ace996766e4d4fd68d505b1f49ecfab998c66198d780751c", "ja": "私は、やっぱり正統派アイドルらしいっていうか……\n明るくて、楽しくて、あたたかくて。", "zh": "我呢，还是希望能像正统派偶像那样……\n给人明亮、欢乐又温暖的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3a4b52e4b1814c3d0441de5070d21d0c1c2f3e6e302a9b47f9a2554096a2141c", "ja": "みんなに笑顔になってもらえるような……\nそんな公演がいいな～って……お、思いますっ。", "zh": "让每个人都能露出笑容……\n我、我想做的……就是这样美好的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9c7284e53a7a6e318e00408e7c3eb5df8243bcda6af7066af9f190dfd5992e0b", "ja": "なるほど。\n風花の……正統派アイドルらしい公演……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n风花想要……有正统派偶像风范的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ee9b7a54d8513aa563d5238487ba1f943cb6e1d74f94cf3b7e189951efe15edb", "ja": "も、もちろん、無理なら仕方ないん……ですけど……\nセンターに立てるだけで、とっても……嬉しいし。", "zh": "如、如果不行的话，当然也……没关系……\n光是能当Center，我就已经……非常高兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12a69b9465eef1401da105a02a9deb7834ccd92e621cdf2aa27cb13c2802ae02", "ja": "でもあのっ、できれば、その～……。", "zh": "可是那个……可以的话，希望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1017_p", "source_sha256": "51fc23af3176732cc412d7403fdeba78d48888b204b3efff4d3dbaf5c33c2e84", "ja": "うん、すごくいいじゃないか！\n風花、それでいってみよう！", "zh": "嗯，这想法不是很棒吗！\n风花，我们就朝这个方向着手吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "be3c50d3096f86bddc8c748ac04e6fd31e70f4cdfe46d3617e4afd161cf7448d", "ja": "…………え？", "zh": "…………咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "dc7a76b824fb54fbc5d9ec80faf7ff6101b08401bf2328aa4a876b2cebbe1d6a", "ja": "風花にぴったりの素敵なテーマだと思いますわ。\nね、可憐？", "zh": "本小姐觉得这主题很棒，再适合风花不过了。\n你说呢，可怜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "a50134512e4013d1af1cd91c146c046911d8347a7b2bc2fd1e81f88ce986bd70", "ja": "はい♪　とっても風花さんらしくて……\nいいと思います♪", "zh": "嗯♪非常有风花姊的风格……\n我觉得很好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1021_p", "source_sha256": "aa99ca9080fea10feeca69191fa30bf2d885a3849884319c3781143a408f8c8e", "ja": "よし、あとでスタッフにも共有しておくよ。\nそれで、ステージのデザインだけど……。", "zh": "好，我待会儿会传达给工作人员的。\n那么，关于舞台的设计……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "be4ca9c23fa893ed6afcc85903f19a94372c124004acd3e01332163245be3968", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　本当に、本当にいいんですか？\nあとで「やっぱり別ので」とか……言いません？", "zh": "请、请等一下！真的、真的可以吗？\n不会之后又说……要更换主题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_1023", "source_sha256": "d37ea5a27dce58a0be60a9b73888a310309d4d41f774ea012e3bc0e11ed954fc", "ja": "言いません", "zh": "不会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2000_p", "source_sha256": "07d6a090b1b5ca507554cee5cc5ad110a7b735f070d6d917006b62ce1211e95f", "ja": "言わないって。公演の主役は風花だからな。\n俺の役目は、主役を輝かせること……。", "zh": "怎么会呢？公演的主角是风花，\n而我的职责，就是让主角发光发热……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2001_p", "source_sha256": "6f883f9e90130f2250234067ca8fc63c8af66b6737097732ee480b658cd3e5cc", "ja": "主役の想いを叶えて、輝かせることだ。\n一緒に頑張ろうな、風花！", "zh": "实现主角的心愿，让主角发光发热。\n我们一起加油吧，风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "70f26029676a06524346eeb3af66134ff4066135c6a35cc11d5cd37ce772a65c", "ja": "はいっ！　私、精いっぱいがんばりますっ。\nだから……よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "是！我会全力以赴的！\n所以……请你多多关照了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "30c6eb73a1338606f3ff390c36104ce5dfb79fbd3454153ecb960bb725fc7f93", "ja": "えへへっ、私がセンターで、正統派アイドルかぁ……♪\nうふっ、うふふっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我当Center，又是正统派偶像啊……♪\n呵呵、呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2005_038chz", "source_sha256": "3716e637cf3eca52cdf009b8fc6c51f3ab05dad78f7a4dfec259499ed892768d", "ja": "ふふっ、まだ準備が始まったばかりですのに……\n楽しみで仕方ない様子ですわね♪", "zh": "呵呵，明明才刚要开始筹备而已……\n她就已经满心期待了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2006_045kar", "source_sha256": "b149856c770eff292bcb9b27019e55e42fef8648e7072a831ddacdd378515eff", "ja": "風花さん……\nなんだか、可愛いです……♪", "zh": "风花姊……\n感觉、有点可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_042_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b0a8a1eb3b406047379665fc00578f389a3118f4f195ec72df153305cc949087", "ja": "（……見ている方も幸せになってくる。\nこの笑顔を、本番でも見せてもらわないとな）", "zh": "（让身旁的人看了也会觉得幸福……这个笑容\n一定要在正式表演时也让观众看到才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
